Description:
 linuxmuster-cli7 - Tools and CLI for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-cli7 (7.4.6) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [passwd] New typer: "lmncli passwd <user>" manages a user's first
     (initial) and current login password - set-first-password,
     set-current-password, set-random-password, reset-first-password and
     check-first-pw. Brings parity with the webui/lmnapi password
     management.
   * [tests] Add coverage for the new passwd typer.
   * [linbo] Adapt "lmncli linbo lastsync" to lmntools' last_sync_all() new
     return shape (host['image'] list of {date, status, image} instead of
     separate host['images']/host['sync']).
